<title>USA: Michaels Stores March same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Michaels Stores March same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $102.3	$93.9	+9.0	 +8.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $200.2     $184.3	+9.0	 +7.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is	 4 weeks ended	March 29.</p>
<p>    Full company name is		     Michaels Stores Inc</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said that a portion of the increase is attributable to the shift in the Easter holiday selling season from the company's fiscal April last year to fiscal March this year.</p>
</text>
